OL,3,AAt least two dead after explosion
OL,4,Adestroys building close to Acropolis in
OL,5,AAthens
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least two people have died and four
OL,8,Fmore are missing after an explosion
OL,9,Fdestroyed a building housing a holiday
OL,10,Frental property in the historic centre
OL,11,Fof Athens.
OL,13,FThe blast happened in the Plaka area of
OL,14,Fthe Greek capital, a neighbourhood
OL,15,Fclose to tourist sites such as the
OL,16,FAcropolis, with local media reporting
OL,17,Fthe building housed a holiday rental.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
